Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:05:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/14] FreeChat: admin-only room TTL and personal
 burn-after-read

- Only power level 100 (or v12 creators) may set com.freechat.disappearing;
  enforced in the client state API. Direct chats make both members admins.
- Users may set com.freechat.disappearing account data {"read_ttl": N},
  globally and per room (0 = off there, no field = follow global). Their
  messages wait until every other joined member has read them (public
  receipt or private read marker, at or after the event), then expire N
  seconds later through the regular expiry path.
